<title>FRANCE: French President Chirac to meet Jospin 1330 GMT.</title>
<headline>French President Chirac to meet Jospin 1330 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac will meet Socialist Prime Minister Lionel Jospin from 1330 GMT on Wednesday, Chirac's office said.</p>
<p>Chirac's office did not say what the subject of the meeting would be but Jospin is expected to present the composition of his government to the president.</p>
